  "note": [
    "Vision-model transcription cache for screenshot evidence.",
    "Each entry is keyed by the SHA-256 of the image bytes, so an edited or replaced",
    "image invalidates its entry instead of silently reusing stale facts. The runtime",
    "never guesses: a screenshot with no entry is reported as an extraction gap.",
    "Only facts visible in the artifact are recorded: the resource reference the",
    "console is scoped to, the record type, its displayed state, and the direct",
    "identifiers actually shown. No deletion verdicts are stored here."
